      "correct_answer": "B",
      "explanation": "OCD: obsessions are ego-DYSTONIC — patient recognizes thoughts as own but unwanted/distressing. Unlike delusions (ego-syntonic). Insight present (unlike psychosis). Treat with SSRI + CBT/ERP."
