      "correct_answer": "B",
      "explanation": "Lithium: mood stabilizer for bipolar disorder (acute mania + prophylaxis). Narrow therapeutic window (0.6-1.2 mEq/L). Monitor: lithium level, TFT (hypothyroidism), renal function (nephrogenic DI), ECG."
